OL,5,G1500 Gilles Peterson
OL,6,     FGilles invites singer Terri Walker
OL,7,     Finto the studio. Plus, a special
OL,8,     Fjazz-fusion session from Butcher
OL,9,     FBrown, and a 'Righteous' mix to
OL,10,     Fround things off.
OL,11,G1800 The Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,12,G     Show
OL,13,     FYazmin Lacey takes over the Trunk
OL,14,     Fof Funk as we continue to mark
OL,15,     FMusic Is Black, a BBC-wide
OL,16,     Fcelebration of Black British music
OL,17,     Fand culture, in partnership with
OL,18,     FV&A East in London.
